      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't even know why i'm typing this. i used to have so much to say, so much to put out into the world. but it's just... gone. there's nothing left inside. every time i sit down to work, i just feel this massive, hollow ache where my passion used to be. i feel like a ghost just haunting my own life. like i'm just taking up space that someone actually talented could be using.",
